01:25:49.800 --> 01:25:50.800
Technically.

01:25:51.800 --> 01:25:57.800
Technically, there's no reason to be less than very happy all the time, because it doesn't

01:25:57.800 --> 01:25:58.800
help anything.

01:25:58.800 --> 01:26:00.800
It doesn't do anything.

01:26:00.800 --> 01:26:01.800
You know?

01:26:01.800 --> 01:26:04.800
I mean, it's true that we live in a bad situation.

01:26:04.800 --> 01:26:09.800
It's true that we have things around us all day that we'd rather not have around us.

01:26:09.800 --> 01:26:14.800
But it's not true that there's any benefit to being irritated by them, because then you

01:26:14.800 --> 01:26:17.800
can't think straight, and you might as well just be happy.

01:26:17.800 --> 01:26:22.800
And then you can deal with ... You can do the opposite.

01:26:22.800 --> 01:26:25.800
We have a thing we call Opposite Day.

01:26:25.800 --> 01:26:27.800
It comes from some movie.

01:26:27.800 --> 01:26:28.800
What?

01:26:28.800 --> 01:26:29.800
It's a song.

01:26:29.800 --> 01:26:30.800
Oh.

01:26:30.800 --> 01:26:33.800
But there was also, I don't know, some movie.

01:26:33.800 --> 01:26:34.800
I don't know.

01:26:34.800 --> 01:26:39.800
There's just a day when you do the opposite of what you'd naturally do, all day long.

01:26:39.800 --> 01:26:47.240
And if somebody, for example, were hassling you, or even, let's say, if you had problems

01:26:47.240 --> 01:26:52.800
in your group with divisiveness, then the only logical thing to do would be to be very

01:26:52.800 --> 01:26:56.800
happy, and never do that kind of thing yourself.

01:26:56.800 --> 01:26:57.800
You know?

01:26:57.800 --> 01:27:05.800
Like, take extra steps to reach out to other people and other groups, and not be divisive.

01:27:05.800 --> 01:27:11.800
Rather than going to the opposite party and trying to talk them into either blah blah

01:27:11.800 --> 01:27:12.800
or blah blah.

01:27:12.800 --> 01:27:14.800
Reconcile or confront.

01:27:14.800 --> 01:27:16.800
That's not the solution, really.

01:27:16.800 --> 01:27:20.800
Well, partly the reconcile might do it, if you did it with wisdom.

01:27:20.800 --> 01:27:25.800
If you said, I'm taking this step so that six months from now I don't see divisiveness.

01:27:25.800 --> 01:27:26.800
You know?

01:27:26.800 --> 01:27:28.800
And you're not trying to work with hard cement.

01:27:28.800 --> 01:27:29.800
You know?

01:27:29.800 --> 01:27:33.800
But going and trying to talk to both parties is like hard cement.

01:27:33.800 --> 01:27:40.800
And don't expect a lot from that, unless you see it as applying to future karma.

01:27:40.800 --> 01:27:41.800
Future karma.

01:27:41.800 --> 01:27:42.800
Yeah.

01:27:42.800 --> 01:27:44.800
Anyway, that's worldview.

01:27:44.800 --> 01:27:48.800
And to me, I mean, that's Buddhism in a nutshell.

01:27:48.800 --> 01:27:50.800
That's all we have to do.

01:27:50.800 --> 01:27:51.800
You know?

01:27:51.800 --> 01:27:53.800
Stop roboclawing and start gardening.

01:27:53.800 --> 01:27:54.800
Right?

