01:32:48.740 --> 01:33:03.740
So the real trick is to, you know, you've got to be in this mood for the next few months, thinking, how do I present this to a new person that walks in?

01:33:03.740 --> 01:33:08.740
You know, like you don't want to dump all this, you don't want to overwhelm them.

01:33:08.740 --> 01:33:15.740
And that's the tendency for people who just got a big dose of Vittara Tantra, you know.

01:33:15.740 --> 01:33:22.740
You want to tell them everything, and you want to tell them all the details, and then they'll just glaze if they're new.

01:33:22.740 --> 01:33:33.740
So your task for the next few months is to really absorb this so well that you can regurgitate it in a normal conversation in normal English,

01:33:33.740 --> 01:33:37.740
in a way that would be easily accessible to a normal person.

01:33:37.740 --> 01:33:40.740
And that's a big skill, that's a very difficult thing.

01:33:40.740 --> 01:33:44.740
And you do a much greater virtue if you...

01:33:45.740 --> 01:33:51.740
convey it to them in a way that they can absorb immediately than if you give them all the details, you know.

01:33:51.740 --> 01:33:58.740
It's good to have the details behind it if they ask, but you have to be in this mode in the next few months.

01:33:58.740 --> 01:34:02.740
Like I just go to bed at night, or I wake up in the morning, I don't get out of bed, I just sit there and think,

01:34:02.740 --> 01:34:05.740
how would I tell this to a normal person, you know.

01:34:05.740 --> 01:34:12.740
And then do that, like, you know, just before you fall asleep, think,

01:34:12.740 --> 01:34:14.740
how would I teach this...

01:34:15.740 --> 01:34:17.740
this verse to a normal person.

01:34:17.740 --> 01:34:21.740
And then you'll be really in the right mood when it comes time.

01:34:21.740 --> 01:34:24.740
Then the right things, the right words will come.

01:34:24.740 --> 01:34:32.740
And it may not at all be like the technical presentation of, you know, all the Sanskrit and Tibetan and blah blah blah.

